AltoReferralWhitelistAdapter::activateReferral
├── when referral address is not whitelisted
│   └── it should revert
├── when referral address equals caller (self-referral)
│   └── it should revert
├── given caller already has referral address set and current referral is whitelisted
│   └── it should revert
└── when referral activation is valid
    ├── when caller has no previous referral
    │   ├── it should set referral mapping
    │   └── it should emit ReferralSet event
    ├── when caller has previous referral but it was removed from whitelist
    │   ├── it should set new referral mapping
    │   └── it should emit ReferralSet event
    └── when setting referral for different users
        ├── it should set referral mapping for each user
        └── it should emit ReferralSet event for each user
